<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<mxfile host="drawio" version="26.0.0">
  <diagram name="dev-loop-unity">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="0" page="1" pageWidth="1700" pageHeight="2200" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="ttl" value="dev-loop-unity — Unity code" style="text;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=26;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0f3355;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="30" width="1500" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="Five changes to /dev-loop: Unity definition of done, batchmode as the validation loop, the Unity Test Framework, a tenth review lane, and escalation that carries Unity forward. Phases without a note below are byte-identical to dev-loop." style="text;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=13;fontColor=#4a7095;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="76" width="1500" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="entry" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;/dev-loop-unity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;fillColor=#0f3355;strokeColor=#0f3355;fontColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="160" width="420" height="48" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="override" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Follow /dev-loop in full&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:left&quot;&gt;Every phase, bound, format and rule is the same. This&lt;br&gt;diagram marks only the five changes below as&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;OVERRIDDEN&lt;/b&gt; — everything else is byte-identical to&lt;br&gt;dev-loop.drawio.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#fbf0d5;strokeColor=#b07a00;fontColor=#4a3600;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="228" width="420" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="esc" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Escalate to dev-loop-ultra — Change 5&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:left&quot;&gt;Where triage hits one of dev-loop's own triggers (a&lt;br&gt;Critical in an unexpected lane, or the same Critical&lt;br&gt;recurring), carry this file's five changes into the&lt;br&gt;escalated run. &lt;b&gt;reviewer-unity runs there as a single&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;reviewer&lt;/b&gt; — no prosecution/defence pair exists for it.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#f7dadd;strokeColor=#9e2b34;fontColor=#5a1a1f;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="920" y="228" width="420" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Phase 0 — Frame the slice — OVERRIDDEN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:left&quot;&gt;Read &lt;b&gt;references/unity-batchmode.md&lt;/b&gt; before writing&lt;br&gt;the brief. Definition of done must include &lt;b&gt;compile&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;check, EditMode tests, and PlayMode tests&lt;/b&gt; all&lt;br&gt;passing. PlayMode may be recorded as &quot;none present&quot;&lt;br&gt;only if the project has no PlayMode assembly.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#1f4e79;strokeColor=#0f3355;fontColor=#ffffff;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="408" width="420" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p0N" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Editor-lock precondition&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:left&quot;&gt;Every batchmode command in this loop checks&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Temp/UnityLockfile&lt;/b&gt; first — if present, the project is&lt;br&gt;open in an Editor and the run fails with an obscure&lt;br&gt;log; ask the user to close it first. Locate the Editor via&lt;br&gt;$UNITY_EDITOR, then ProjectSettings/ProjectVersion.txt,&lt;br&gt;then stop and ask — &lt;b&gt;never guess a different version.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#b8b8b8;fontColor=#4a4a4a;dashed=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="920" y="408" width="420" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Phase 1 — Implement — OVERRIDDEN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:left&quot;&gt;Sidekick briefs name the unity-batchmode.md&lt;br&gt;commands as &lt;b&gt;the validation loop&lt;/b&gt; the sidekick must&lt;br&gt;run, and &lt;b&gt;forbid hand-editing .unity/.prefab YAML&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;wherever an editor script or the component API would&lt;br&gt;do the same job — hand edits break fileID references.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#1f4e79;strokeColor=#0f3355;fontColor=#ffffff;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="628" width="420" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Phase 2 — Tests — OVERRIDDEN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:left&quot;&gt;Tests use the &lt;b&gt;Unity Test Framework&lt;/b&gt;, not a generic&lt;br&gt;test runner. Pure logic goes in &lt;b&gt;EditMode&lt;/b&gt;; anything&lt;br&gt;needing frames, physics, or a loaded scene goes in&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;PlayMode&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#1f4e79;strokeColor=#0f3355;fontColor=#ffffff;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="798" width="420" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Phase 3 — Plan the review round — OVERRIDDEN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:left&quot;&gt;Add &lt;b&gt;reviewer-unity&lt;/b&gt; to the lane table below —&lt;br&gt;opus, high; applicable whenever Assets/, Packages/, or&lt;br&gt;ProjectSettings/ changed. &lt;b&gt;It counts toward Phase 4's&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;four-at-a-time wave limit&lt;/b&gt; like every other lane — it&lt;br&gt;does not get a wave of its own.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#1f4e79;strokeColor=#0f3355;fontColor=#ffffff;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="948" width="420" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Phase 4 — Delegate — OVERRIDDEN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:left&quot;&gt;reviewer-artifacts's prompt gains an addendum:&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;.meta, .unity, .prefab, .asset and .asmdef&lt;/b&gt; files are&lt;br&gt;now owned by the Unity lane. Artifacts keeps&lt;br&gt;Packages/manifest.json, packages-lock.json, and CI.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#1f4e79;strokeColor=#0f3355;fontColor=#ffffff;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="1118" width="420" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lanes" value="Ten lanes — nine unchanged from dev-loop, plus Unity added by this override" style="swimlane;startSize=34;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;fontColor=#12263f;fontStyle=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;container=1;pointerEvents=0;collapsible=0;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1288" width="1500" height="280" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="base9" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:4px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Requirements · Technical · Tests · Architecture · Standards · Security · Dead code · Minimalism · Artifacts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.4;text-align:center&quot;&gt;unchanged — see dev-loop.drawio for each lane's model, gating and ownership. Artifacts' gating narrows per Phase 4, above.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#e7eef5;strokeColor=#4a7095;fontColor=#12263f;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="lanes"><mxGeometry x="14" y="42" width="1470" height="54" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="uh" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:12px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Unity — opus · high — NEW&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#dcefe3;strokeColor=#2e6f4e;fontColor=#123328;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="lanes"><mxGeometry x="14" y="110" width="1470" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ug" value="gated: Assets/, Packages/, or ProjectSettings/ changed" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#fbf0d5;strokeColor=#b07a00;fontColor=#4a3600;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="lanes"><mxGeometry x="14" y="142" width="1470" height="24" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ub" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:left&quot;&gt;serialized-field data loss (renamed/moved [SerializeField] or public field without [FormerlySerializedAs], changed field type); asset-database integrity (missing .meta, GUID changed on move, orphaned .meta); broken fileID/GUID references in .unity/.prefab/.asset YAML; .asmdef references and platform constraints; lifecycle-order dependence (Awake/OnEnable/Start, script execution order); Unity API calls off the main thread; per-frame allocations and Find/GetComponent in Update/FixedUpdate/LateUpdate; UnityEditor APIs in runtime assemblies; == null misuse on destroyed UnityEngine.Objects.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b8b8b8;fontColor=#4a4a4a;align=left;spacingLeft=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="lanes"><mxGeometry x="14" y="170" width="1470" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="integ" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:center&quot;&gt;Phase 4 lanes drained (unchanged) — retake&lt;br&gt;the snapshot and compare against plan.md,&lt;br&gt;before reading a single finding&lt;/div&gt;" style="rhombus;fillColor=#fbf0d5;strokeColor=#b07a00;fontColor=#4a3600;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="480" y="1608" width="400" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Phase 5 — Triage — OVERRIDDEN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:left&quot;&gt;Otherwise identical to dev-loop's triage. Where it&lt;br&gt;surfaces one of dev-loop's own escalation triggers (a&lt;br&gt;Critical in an unexpected lane, or the same Critical&lt;br&gt;recurring after a fix), &lt;b&gt;carry this file's five changes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;into the escalated dev-loop-ultra run&lt;/b&gt; — see&lt;br&gt;Change 5, above.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#1f4e79;strokeColor=#0f3355;fontColor=#ffffff;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="1768" width="420" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Phase 6 — Fix — OVERRIDDEN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:left&quot;&gt;Fix briefs name the &lt;b&gt;same unity-batchmode.md&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;commands&lt;/b&gt; as the validation loop, and carry the&lt;br&gt;same hand-edited-YAML prohibition as Phase 1.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#1f4e79;strokeColor=#0f3355;fontColor=#ffffff;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="1948" width="420" height="130" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p7" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Phase 7 — loop or exit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.4;text-align:center&quot;&gt;(unchanged)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rhombus;fillColor=#fbf0d5;strokeColor=#b07a00;fontColor=#4a3600;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="480" y="2108" width="400" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p7L" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;BLOCKED (unchanged)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:left&quot;&gt;Same three bounds as dev-loop: ROUND would exceed&lt;br&gt;3, a concern raised and fixed twice, or a round with&lt;br&gt;no material progress.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#f7dadd;strokeColor=#9e2b34;fontColor=#5a1a1f;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="2108" width="420" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p7R" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;ROUND + 1 → back to Phase 3 (unchanged)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#fbf0d5;strokeColor=#b07a00;fontColor=#4a3600;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="930" y="2133" width="400" height="60" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p8" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Phase 8 — Independent verification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.4;text-align:center&quot;&gt;(unchanged)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rhombus;fillColor=#fbf0d5;strokeColor=#b07a00;fontColor=#4a3600;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="480" y="2258" width="400" height="140" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;reviewer-verify (unchanged)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:left&quot;&gt; — opus, high, spawned once. Same four questions as dev-loop's Phase 8.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;fillColor=#dcefe3;strokeColor=#2e6f4e;fontColor=#123328;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="2258" width="420" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p8b" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Phase 8b — Walkthrough&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.4;text-align:center&quot;&gt;(unchanged)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#1f4e79;strokeColor=#0f3355;fontColor=#ffffff;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="2438" width="420" height="90" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p9" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center;margin-bottom:5px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Phase 9 — Commit, push, pull request&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;text-align:left&quot;&gt;Otherwise identical to dev-loop's Phase 9.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Run identity:&lt;/b&gt; notes.md records &lt;b&gt;loop:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;dev-loop-unity&lt;/b&gt;; findings and index.jsonl use&lt;br&gt;&amp;quot;loop&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;unity&amp;quot;, not &amp;quot;full&amp;quot;.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#1f4e79;strokeColor=#0f3355;fontColor=#ffffff;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="2558" width="420" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="done" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:15px;line-height:1.3;text-align:center&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;done&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;fillColor=#dcefe3;strokeColor=#2e6f4e;fontColor=#123328;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="2778" width="200" height="48" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e0" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;" edge="1" parent="1" source="entry" target="override"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e0b" value="on escalation" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="override" target="esc"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;" edge="1" parent="1" source="override" target="p0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p0" target="p1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p1" target="p2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e4" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p2" target="p3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e5" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p3" target="p4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e11" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.44;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p4" target="lanes"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e12" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;exitX=0.44;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="lanes" target="integ"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e6" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;" edge="1" parent="1" source="integ" target="p5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e7" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p5" target="p6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e8" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4a3600;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#4a7095;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p6" target="p7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
